        "text": "11 Surprise Pregnancy Announcements to Drop Your Unexpected Baby News Fact Checked by Olivia DeLong, Senior Health Editor",
        "text_sha256": "79e720e3c7736a5f1b561c5f4b387d1d69b02742cc64f2738547f1bc41d4b89e",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Moms Are Sharing Their Craziest Pregnancy Symptoms, and Some of Them Are Truly Wild Medically Reviewed by Tarun Jain, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "0150fe6ae1a1153b28a96620380ed85cf31e4d9080da709346811e0c2d21f738",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
